  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "style": "narrator",
      "text": "身後的轟鳴，\n已近得足以蓋過你的呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "style": "heavy",
      "text": "沒有時間了。",
      "post_delay": 0.75
    },
    {
      "speaker": "doctor",
      "style": "thought",
      "text": "［不行……身體已經不聽使喚了。］"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "doctor",
      "style": "heavy",
      "text": "［我要死在這裡了嗎？］",
      "typing_speed": 8.25,
      "post_delay": 0.9
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "style": "heavy",
      "text": "前方最後一段道路，\n正在崩塌中逐漸斷裂。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "style": "narrator",
      "scene_transition": "scene2",
      "text": "就在此時——\n一道蒼白的光穿過了煙塵。",
      "post_delay": 0.8
    },
    {
      "speaker": "doctor",
      "style": "thought",
      "text": "［……光？］",
      "typing_speed": 8.0,
      "post_delay": 0.65
    },
    {
      "speaker": "doctor",
      "style": "thought",
      "text": "［等等……那是出口？］",
      "typing_speed": 8.5,
      "post_delay": 0.85
    },
    {
      "speaker": "doctor",
      "style": "heavy",
      "text": "［還沒結束。］"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "style": "heavy",
      "text": "你向那道光，\n重新邁出了腳步。",
      "typing_speed": 9.0,
      "post_delay": 0.9
    }
  ]
}
